		{
			dependencies: ["72090D36C27DC4AF"]
			description: [
				"欢迎来到&e第三章&r。"
				""
				"本章节的重点是获取你的第一台&a电气机器&r、&b铝&r、&e不锈钢&r和&d石油加工设备&r！内容繁多，快开始吧！"
				""
				"&d&l超频&r&r"
				"The main advantage of &aelectric machines&r over their &7steam counterparts&r is the ability to &doverclock&r them. This happens automatically while the &2machine is runnining&r, where each craft will use more power than the previous up to a soft cap of &632 EU/t&r with unupgraded machines. The &emore power&r being used in the recipe, the &9faster the recipe&r is. This soft cap of &632 EU/t&r can be surpassed later with the use of &emachine upgrades&r."
				""
				"如果机器&c停止运行&r配方，或&c电力耗尽&r，&d超频&r会迅速丢失。 &a你应该尽量保持机器始终运行&r以维持它们的&d超频&r。"
				""
				"With enough &eupgrades&r, you can reach a hard cap of &a&o1 recipe per tick&r&r!"
			]
			id: "473C1DE557D3E9C0"
			rewards: [
